<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Natsume returns two weeks after his endoscopy. The epigastric pain stopped within four days of starting vonoprazan, and he now sleeps through the night. His stools are dark and formed on iron, with no sticky, tarry stools; he has not vomited or felt faint. He takes the iron every other morning without stomach upset. He has taken no NSAIDs. He is writing his serial again each morning and eats at more regular hours. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Pain</td><td>Gone within four days of vonoprazan</td></tr><tr><td>Stools</td><td>Dark and formed on iron; no tarry stools</td></tr><tr><td>Medicines</td><td>Vonoprazan 20 mg each morning; ferrous sulfate every other morning; no NSAIDs</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

